    {
      "id": "q031",
      "type": "risk_narrative",
      "recall": 1.0,
      "mrr": 0.3333333333333333,
      "citation_precision": 1.0,
      "must_refuse": false,
      "actually_refused": false,
      "refusal_correct": true,
      "grounded": true,
      "latency_ms": 8588.37108395528,
      "tokens": 4053,
      "cost_usd": 0.0006858,
      "answer": "NVIDIA discloses that as geopolitical tensions have increased, semiconductors associated with AI, including GPUs and related products, are increasingly the focus of export control restrictions proposed by stakeholders in the U.S. and its allies. The United States has imposed unilateral worldwide controls restricting GPUs and associated products, and it is likely that additional unilateral or multilateral controls will be adopted. Such controls could prohibit NVIDIA from exporting its products to any or all customers in one or more markets, including China and over 150 countries designated \u201cTier 2\u201d by the January 2025 AI Diffusion IFR, which could negatively impact its manufacturing, testing, and warehousing locations and options, or impose other conditions that limit its ability to serve demand abroad, negatively and materially impacting its business, revenue, and financial results [c:NVDA_2025_1A_29]."
    },
    {
      "id": "q032",
      "type": "risk_narrative",
      "recall": 1.0,
      "mrr": 0.5,
      "citation_precision": 1.0,
      "must_refuse": false,
      "actually_refused": false,
      "refusal_correct": true,
      "grounded": true,
      "latency_ms": 8691.516708000563,
      "tokens": 4108,
      "cost_usd": 0.0006756,
      "answer": "Alphabet discloses that it generates a significant portion of its revenues from advertising, specifically stating that more than 75% of total revenues came from online advertising in 2024. The company notes that reduced spending by advertisers, a loss of partners, or technologies that block ads could harm its business. Additionally, many advertisers can terminate their contracts at any time, and changes in advertising policies and data privacy practices may affect the services provided. Adverse macroeconomic conditions could also impact the demand for advertising, leading to fluctuations in advertiser spending, which could harm Alphabet's financial condition and operating results [c:GOOGL_2024_1A_0]."
    },
